<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>新闻资讯 | XCAGI</title>
  <meta name="description" content="XCAGI 产品动态与企业业务自动化行业观察。" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="XCAGI" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="新闻资讯 | XCAGI" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="XCAGI 产品动态与企业业务自动化行业观察。" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://xiu-ci.com/news.html" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://xiu-ci.com/assets/brand-logo.jpg" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://xiu-ci.com/news.html" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/xiu-ci-logo.png" type="image/png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css?v={{ cssQuery }}" />
</head>
<body>
{% set activeNav = 'news' %}
{% include "partials/header.njk" %}
<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">News</span>
        <h1>新闻资讯</h1>
        <p>记录修茈科技的产品动态、公司公告与对 AI 自动化、Agent 与职场协作的行业观察。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-side">
        <p>资讯列表在构建时从数据文件生成，便于统一维护与审阅；更新流程见站内编辑说明。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        {% for item in newsItems %}
        <article class="news-card reveal" {% if loop.index0 > 0 %}data-delay="{{ (loop.index0 % 3) * 80 }}"{% endif %}>
          <span class="news-label">{{ item.category }}</span>
          <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
          {% if item.date %}
          <p class="footer-meta">{{ item.date }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
<button id="back-to-top" class="back-to-top" aria-label="回到顶部"></button>
<script src="./main.js?v={{ cssQuery }}"></script>
{% include "partials/corp-butler.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
